# Unseen Servant

Pre-release. Unannounced. If you've found this early, please don't share it around yet — nothing here is asking for visitors until it clears its own quality bar.

A security-first Gemini server, written in Rust, that publishes one content tree to two worlds: served natively as gemtext on port 1965, and statically rendered to themed, classless HTML for the web. Write a gemlog once; readers reach it from Lagrange or lynx or Chrome, whichever they have open.

This capsule is usv serving itself — the project dogfoods its own server.

